  "provenance": "Candidate 360 clip. Genuine capture skipped: weather gate (Open-Meteo current retrievals on 2026-10-02 13:40–13:41 Europe/Amsterdam were daytime, is_day 1, but not mostly clear: cloud cover 67–100% and WMO code 2 or 3). Shipped from the genuine Part A daylight 16:9 master (NL-01-099–107 on Candidate draft PR #44 tip f841ba12aeedbf568e624778afe61a293e0363f7; NL-01-108 on Candidate draft PR #42 tip 180c4f2178b0580f394b942fe073f8991706564c) after the 190px label bar was cropped. Those stills were read as clip anchors only and are not in this pack. 10.0s 864x1080 24fps 4:5 synthetic orbit: daylight 4:5 crop at 0 degrees, generated views at about 60, 120, and 180 degrees, joined by optical-flow interpolation. First frame is that daylight crop. Not a field capture. Not a drift-only push-in. In-between frames are motion-compensated blends and can ghost. Not Cosmo-approved. The night master was not modified.",
